; The two non-zero boundaries, each with the ulp below it, exactly as the
; integer-path twin asks them — but here every start second came out of
; the f64 arithmetic rather than an i128, which is the difference the
; gate is about.
;
; 4020086B58AA7DC3 is where segment 1 begins (13 quarters at 97.3 quarter
; notes per minute: 8.016443...s) and 402A6ED1BF10E42A where segment 2
; does (thirteen more at 150: 13.2164...s). One ulp below each is the
; tick before, because a clock value floors.
(times "4020086B58AA7DC3" "4020086B58AA7DC2")
(times "402A6ED1BF10E42A" "402A6ED1BF10E429")
; …and the same two boundaries asked by TICK, which is plan 03's phase-2
; row in as many words: tick 599 639 040 comes back from its own seconds.
(at :tick 599639040)
(at :tick 1199278080)
